      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT to understand the code before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing all unused data provider methods (14 dead helpers that belong to the larger test class)\n2. Removing all unused imports\n3. Organizing `data_plus()` rows into named groups by temporal unit with clear formattingNow I'll compile-check the file.The improved test compiles successfully. The refactored file removes 14 unused data provider methods and ~30 unused imports, then reorganizes `data_plus()` rows into clearly labelled groups by temporal unit (DAYS, WEEKS, MONTHS, YEARS, DECADES, CENTURIES, MILLENNIA) with per-row comments explaining intent — all while keeping every original test case and method call intact."
